   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "ans_ravina_talei_bemaaseh",
     "gloss_en": "even the Rabbis do not follow a majority that depends on an act",
     "answers": "obj_rov_behemot",
     "restores": "p_matnitin_ry_mikan_safek"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_ravina_ruba_delo_talei_bemaaseh",
     "gloss_en": "Ravina: even [like] the Rabbis -- they follow a majority that does not depend on an act; a majority that depends on an act -- no"
    }
   ]
  },
  "7": {
   "segId": "Bekhorot.20a.8",
   "sugya": "bekhorot_19b_rov_behemot_mitabrot",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_vehaamar_rava",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "ולא חייש? והאמר רבא: מחוורתא רבי ישמעאל כרבי מאיר סבירא ליה, דחייש למיעוט!",
     "against": "p_ry_ein_chosheshin_letinuf",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "ans_lechumra",
     "gloss_en": "כי חייש -- לחומרא, לקולא -- לא חייש",
     "answers": "obj_vehaamar_rava",
     "restores": "p_ry_ein_chosheshin_letinuf"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_ry_chayesh_lechumra",
     "gloss_en": "where he [R' Yishmael] is concerned, it is for stringency; for leniency he is not concerned"
    }
   ]
  },
  "8": {
   "segId": "Bekhorot.20a.9",
   "sugya": "bekhorot_19b_rov_behemot_mitabrot",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "ans_mtanefet_chozeret",
     "gloss_en": "ואיבעית אימא: he is concerned both ways, and they dispute instead whether a discharging animal returns and gives birth within its year (this account drops the target rather than defending it)",
     "answers": "obj_vehaamar_rava",
     "restores": "p_ry_ein_chosheshin_letinuf"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_ry_chayesh_bein_lekula",
     "gloss_en": "or say: he is concerned whether for leniency or for stringency"
    }
   ]
  },
  "2": {
   "segId": "Bekhorot.20a.3",
   "sugya": "bekhorot_19b_rov_behemot_mitabrot",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_baraita_ry_ez",
     "gloss_en": "the baraita, R' Yishmael: a goat within its year -- certainly the priest's; from there on -- uncertain"
